{"cityName":"Greater Toronto Area","populationYear":2021,"incomeYear":2020,"preparedDate":"2026-11-06","cityIncomeMedian":null,"populationLabel":"私人住户人口","populationDefinition":"人口构成使用2021年普查 Visible minority 表中的私人住户人口（25%抽样数据）。总人口另取完整人口统计，两个分母分别保留。","incomeDefinition":"2021年普查公布的2020年私人住户税前家庭总年收入中位数，单位为加元。范围基准直接采用该市镇或地区的官方中位数。GTA整体没有可用的同口径中位数，因此留空。","chineseDefinition":"Chinese 采用2021年普查 Visible minority 分类。占比由该类别人数除以同一张表的私人住户人口计算。此分类与国籍、出生地或语言分别统计。","childrenDefinition":"0–14岁比例直接取自普查年龄分布表公布值，分母为总人口。","householdSizeDefinition":"平均私人住户人数采用普查直接公布值。","roundingNote":"普查人数经过随机取整，分类合计与人口分母可能存在小幅差异。GTA总体人口构成由五个地区官方总数相加，未使用普查区加总替代市镇或地区基准。","boundaryNote":"采用加拿大统计局2021年普查区边界，共1,339个普查区。Scugog、Brock及Mississaugas of Scugog Island没有普查区划分，地图在这三处展示整个市镇统计区并注明地理级别。边界联合简化以保留相邻区域的共同边线。","missingDataNote":"缺失、未公布和保密抑制值保留为空，明确公布的0保留为0。收入排名仅比较同一市镇内有公布收入的普查区，整个市镇统计区不参与排名。","latestCensusNote":"本图的人口和人口群体数据来自2021年联邦普查，收入参考年份为2020年。数据年份在详情中标出。","populationGroupsDefinition":"保留2021年普查的13个原始 Visible minority 分类。非可见少数族裔分类包含原住民，类别名称采用统计局定义。","populationChartNote":"圆环扇区按同表人数和私人住户人口计算。未选择的人群合并为灰色，原表统计差额留白。","license":"包含根据加拿大统计局开放许可发布的2021年普查统计和边界数据。Leaflet使用BSD 2-Clause许可。地图背景及交通来源见各项来源链接。","scopeNote":"范围覆盖Toronto、Peel、York、Durham及Halton，包括25个市镇及这五个地区内的两个第一民族普查统计区。普查区用所属市镇和官方编号标识。","english":{"populationLabel":"Private-household population","populationDefinition":"Population composition uses the population in private households from the 2021 Census visible-minority table (25% sample data). Total population is retained separately from the complete population count.","incomeDefinition":"Median total before-tax income of private households in 2020, as published by the 2021 Census, in Canadian dollars. Scope benchmarks use the directly published municipality or regional median. The GTA-wide median is left unavailable because a comparable published total was not obtained.","chineseDefinition":"Chinese is the original 2021 Census visible-minority category. Its share is the count divided by private-household population from the same table. Citizenship, birthplace and language are separate Census concepts.","childrenDefinition":"The share aged 0–14 is the directly published Census age-distribution percentage of the total population.","householdSizeDefinition":"Average household size is the directly published average number of people in private households.","roundingNote":"Census counts are randomly rounded, so category totals can differ slightly from the population denominator. GTA population composition sums the five official census-division totals. Municipal and regional benchmarks use their directly published totals.","boundaryNote":"The map uses 1,339 official 2021 Statistics Canada census tracts. Scugog, Brock and Mississaugas of Scugog Island have no census-tract coverage; these three locations display their entire census subdivisions with the geography level identified. Boundaries are simplified together to preserve shared edges.","missingDataNote":"Missing, unpublished and confidentially suppressed values stay unavailable; published zeros stay zero. Income ranks compare reported census tracts within the same municipality. Municipality-level fallback areas are excluded from tract rankings.","latestCensusNote":"Population and population-group statistics come from the 2021 federal Census; income refers to 2020. The detail panel identifies these reference years.","populationGroupsDefinition":"The 13 original 2021 Census visible-minority categories are retained. The “Not a visible minority” category includes Indigenous people. Category names follow Statistics Canada definitions.","populationChartNote":"Ring segments use counts and the private-household population from the same table. Unselected categories are grey and differences in the original table remain unfilled.","license":"Contains 2021 Census statistics and boundaries released under the Statistics Canada Open Licence. Leaflet uses the BSD 2-Clause licence. Basemap and transport sources are listed individually.","scopeNote":"Coverage includes Toronto, Peel, York, Durham and Halton, comprising 25 municipalities and two First Nations census subdivisions. Census tracts are identified by their municipality and official tract number.","transitDefinition":"Routes and stations use official GTFS snapshots; operating status was checked on November 6, 2026. The map displays geographic routes, with no real-time arrivals or daily service information.","geographyDefinition":"Context geometry uses official Ontario, Toronto and federal data. Parks combine protected and conserved areas and Toronto municipal parks of at least 5 hectares.","transitAttribution":"Data used in this product or service is provided with the permission of Metrolinx. Metrolinx makes no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, with respect to the Data and assumes no responsibility for the accuracy or currency of the data used in this product or service."},"sources":[{"label":"Statistics Canada · 2021 Census Profile","url":"https://www12.statcan.gc.ca/census-recensement/2021/dp-pd/prof/index.cfm?Lang=E"},{"label":"Statistics Canada · Census Profile API","url":"https://www12.statcan.gc.ca/wds-sdw/2021profile-profil2021-eng.cfm"},{"label":"Statistics Canada · 2021 Census boundaries","url":"https://www12.statcan.gc.ca/census-recensement/2021/geo/sip-pis/boundary-limites/index2021-eng.cfm"},{"label":"Statistics Canada · Open Licence","url":"https://www.statcan.gc.ca/en/reference/licence"},{"label":"Ontario · Airports","url":"https://data.ontario.ca/dataset/2582c87b-03b4-406c-af6b-3cfea418dc7b"},{"label":"Ontario · Road Network","url":"https://data.ontario.ca/dataset/f61ce160-e432-4f4d-a06c-508b3da384f9"},{"label":"Ontario · Hydrography","url":"https://data.ontario.ca/dataset/423655e0-2bb8-4dc2-a1ec-6d7b25915d18"},{"label":"Ontario · Railway Track","url":"https://data.ontario.ca/dataset/5ff2a676-d1a4-4aa1-88ce-0a7d7ac28d75"},{"label":"Canada · Protected and Conserved Areas","url":"https://open.canada.ca/data/en/dataset/6c343726-1e92-451a-876a-76e17d398a1c"},{"label":"Canada · Canada Lands Administrative Boundaries","url":"https://open.canada.ca/data/en/dataset/522b07b9-78e2-4819-b736-ad9208eb1067"},{"label":"Ontario · Geographic Names","url":"https://www.ontario.ca/page/geographic-names"},{"label":"Toronto · Municipal parks","url":"https://open.toronto.ca/dataset/parks/"},{"label":"Toronto · Places of interest","url":"https://open.toronto.ca/dataset/places-of-interest-and-toronto-attractions/"},{"label":"TTC · Official GTFS","url":"https://open.toronto.ca/dataset/ttc-routes-and-schedules/"},{"label":"GO Transit · Official GTFS","url":"https://www.gotransit.com/en/partner-with-us/software-developers"},{"label":"UP Express · Official GTFS","url":"https://www.gotransit.com/en/partner-with-us/software-developers"}],"geographyPreparedDate":"2026-11-06","transitDefinition":"交通线路与站点来自官方GTFS快照，线路运营状态核对日期为2026-11-06。地图展示地理线路，不提供实时到站或当日服务安排。","geographyDefinition":"地理背景来自安省、多伦多市及加拿大联邦官方数据。绿地包含保护地和多伦多市面积至少5公顷的市属公园。","transitAttribution":"Data used in this product or service is provided with the permission of Metrolinx. Metrolinx makes no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, with respect to the Data and assumes no responsibility for the accuracy or currency of the data used in this product or service.","scopes":[{"id":"gta","name":"Greater Toronto Area","type":"gta","incomeMedian":null,"totalPopulation":6712341,"bounds":[-80.16036,43.286116,-78.436959,44.516753]},{"id":"3518","name":"Durham","type":"region","incomeMedian":107000,"totalPopulation":696992,"sourceUrl":"https://www12.statcan.gc.ca/census-recensement/2021/dp-pd/prof/details/page.cfm?Lang=E&DGUIDlist=2021A00033518&GENDERlist=1&STATISTIClist=1&HEADERlist=0","bounds":[-79.328017,43.794394,-78.436959,44.516753]},{"id":"3519","name":"York","type":"region","incomeMedian":112000,"totalPopulation":1173334,"sourceUrl":"https://www12.statcan.gc.ca/census-recensement/2021/dp-pd/prof/de